  "label": "User projected onto the visual metaphor of white people walking on all fours",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material 'man_in_suit_crawling' as a representation of 'white people walking on all fours'. The meme uses this visual to imply the user (or the viewer's identity as a white person) is being depicted in a degrading, primitive state, which is a projection of the user's racial identity onto the crawling figure. This projection is part of the meme's hateful intent to demean Black people by portraying them as the 'superior' force that 'taught' white people to stand upright.",
